                    	TASK VIEW HELP FACILITY


    Function Keys :

        O           -  Omit Layer.
        I           -  Insert Layer.
        S           -  Step Through Layers.
        S           -  Show All Layers.
        P           -  Print Part Number.
        D           -  Screen Dump To Printer.
        Q           -  Return To File List.

    Viewing Keys :

        UP ARROW    -  Scroll Drawing Down.
        DOWN ARROW  -  Scroll Drawing Up.
        LEFT ARROW  -  Pan Drawing Right.
        RIGHT ARROW -  Pan Drawing Left.
        INSERT      -  Zoom Out Of Drawing.
        DEL         -  Zoom In To Drawing.
        CTRL-BREAK  -  Exit Task View.


    Text Keys :

        T           -  Show Text Window.
        HOME        -  Move To Top Of Text.
        END         -  Move To End Of Text.
        PGDN        -  Page Down Through Text.
        PGUP        -  Page Up Through Text.
        0           -  Toggle Text Window Between
                       Opaque And Transparent.
        1-9         -  Select Different Text Windows.
        CTRL-BREAK  -  Clear Text Window.

    Help Keys :

        H           -  Show Help Window.

        All Other Key Presses Are The
        The Same As Text Mode.

    Terminal Keys

        C           -  Select Terminal Mode.
        ESC         -  Clear Terminal Mode.

        Any Other Keys Used In Terminal Mode
        Are Not Interpreted By Task View.

